Specifically, scripts/bridge.mjs imports at runtime the following modules from
that package (located via $DSH_HOME/profiles/*/node_modules/dsh-opencode-xdbridge/lib
or OPENCODE_BRIDGE_PLUGIN_LIB):

  - runtime.js          (isolated `opencode serve` launcher)
  - backend.js          (one inference turn; free-model catalog)
  - protocol.js         (OpenAI <-> JSON-envelope translation)
  - context-budget.js   (usable context window)

No files from that project are copied into this repository; they are consumed
as a dependency at runtime. Their MIT license and copyright remain in force.

OpenCode itself (the `opencode` binary) is a separate project by its own
authors and is not redistributed here.
